een, No chance to use it. Will remove this 122MB rubbish.\",[1741590711,967000000],1,[\"The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation Ltd\",\"Hi Ronald Raku, thank you for your message. We would like to understand more about your case and offer assistance. Please contact us through our customer service hotlines. Thanks!\",[1741603770,181000000]],null,[\"112494681406646339371\",\"Ronald Raku\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXNDG7TCyYs0tvecJZanzAnBb4DeBKNg2nIBV6ZSVRmluL_H-w\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.55.0\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"342475c0-e794-473b-b38b-6e457acb9d94\",[\"Danny Ng\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIYJby22o83pSBQ8twM6mktuvNwmQbG9dqtnyNzKbDDzZTofA\\u003dmo\"]]],2,null,\"Your app at Android (mine is 14) frequently hangs up before login screen ever shows up.  It takes a cold reboot to bring back normal,l. And then after \\\"reusing\\\" for some time / days, the problem recurs.  Never experienced such problem in any other apps, or banking apps.  Neither was your app some versions before, only until recent versions.  Please check / fix the bug (may be problem in memory handling / clearing some \\\"garage\\\" accumulated).\",[1741573078,237000000],13,[\"The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation Ltd\",\"Hi Danny Ng, thank you for your message. We would like to understand more about your case and offer assistance. Please logon HSBC HK App and ‘Chat with us’ by tapping ‘Support’ tab. Alternatively, please contact us through our HSBC Online Banking via ‘Chat with us’ or customer service hotlines. Thanks!\",[1741579591,236000000]],null,[\"115776315558120911369\",\"Danny Ng\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIYJby22o83pSBQ8twM6mktuvNwmQbG9dqtnyNzKbDDzZTofA\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,nul